---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="KickzBrary Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for KickzBrary by HSL Innovations."
>
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
    <div class="page-app-icon">
        <img
          src="/icons/kickzbrary.png"
          alt="KickzBrary app icon"
          class="app-icon"
        />
    </div>
    <h1>KickzBrary</h1>
    <p>
      KickzBrary is designed with privacy in mind. The app does not sell your
      personal information or use your collection data for advertising.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-card">
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 2026</p>
    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 2026</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary is developed and published by HSL Innovations. This Privacy
      Policy explains what information KickzBrary uses and how that information
      is handled.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary does not require you to provide your name, email address,
      phone number, or location. The app does not collect advertising
      identifiers and does not track you across apps or websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Collection Data</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary stores the information you add to your sneaker library so it
      can organize and display your collection. This may include:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Sneaker names, brands, models, sizes, and colorways</li>
      <li>Purchase details and personal notes you choose to enter</li>
      <li>Photos you choose to add to your collection</li>
      <li>Collection statistics generated from your library</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      HSL Innovations does not sell your collection data or use it to build an
      advertising profile. You control the information you choose to add,
      import, or export.
    </p>

    <h2>Photos</h2>
    <p>
      If you choose to add sneaker photos, KickzBrary may request permission to
      access your photo library or camera. This access is used only when you
      choose to add or create an image for your collection. You can change
      photo or camera permissions at any time in your device settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Import and Export</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary may let you import or export collection data. Files are handled
      only at your direction. Once you export or share a file outside the app,
      its privacy is governed by the location or service you select.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary does not include advertising networks or third-party tracking
      software. If future versions add an optional service that handles data,
      this policy will be updated to explain that service before the feature is
      made available.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      HSL Innovations does not sell or rent your personal information. Your
      information is disclosed only when you direct the app to export or share
      it, or when disclosure is required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
    <p>
      You can edit or delete entries from your collection within the app.
      Removing the app may remove data stored locally on your device. Before
      deleting the app, export any collection information you want to keep.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary does not knowingly collect personal information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy may be updated as KickzBrary evolves. The effective
      date at the top of this page will indicate the most recent version.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact HSL
      Innovations through the <a href="/support">Support page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
